  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 1, 'Make yourself a warm drink, settle into a comfy seat and simply sit with it for a few quiet minutes before you look at anything.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 2, 'Take one slow breath and name a single thing you would like this week to hold.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 3, 'Close your eyes for a moment and imagine the most restful hour you could have this week.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 4, 'Set your keys in one small bowl by the door tonight, and enjoy knowing exactly where they will be in the morning.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 5, 'Remind yourself as you wake that a plan is a guess, and today is allowed to go its own way.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 6, 'Open your calendar for the week ahead and read it through once, slowly, without changing a single thing.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 7, 'Write down the three tasks that would make the week ahead feel lighter if they were done.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 8, 'Choose one evening this week and write "free" across it in your calendar.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 9, 'Jot down three easy meals you would be glad to eat this week, nothing fancy, just ones you already know well.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 10, 'Choose one task on today''s list that can wait, and move it to another day without writing a reason.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 11, 'Write the few fixed things in your coming week on a small card and keep it where you will see it.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 12, 'Circle just one item on your list that matters most, and let the rest sit quietly beside it.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 13, 'Leave fifteen minutes between two appointments this week so you can stretch, sip water and arrive calm.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 14, 'Start a grocery list on the fridge door so anyone in the house can add to it as things run low.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 15, 'Draft a warm, short text you could send if you need to cancel something, and save it for later.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 16, 'Notice which day ahead looks the busiest, and circle it softly in pencil so it has your attention.'),
  ('planning-a-calmer-week', 17, 'Choose one sentence you can use to say "not this week" kindly, and keep it ready.'),
